From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucascouts <lucascs@protonmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 16:27:51 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] agent_ui: pause and resume the conversation's auto-scroll
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wave 2 of the Zeo next proposal (docs/ZEO-NEXT-PROPOSAL.md §5.8, ask 28),
on top of 0026 as re-authored for d2a4fb6. A Pause/Resume toggle opens
the floating controls. Paused, the view never follows the tail, even
when it sits at the bottom; a "N new" label counts the entries that
arrived since the pause. Resuming snaps to the end and follows again.

Paused is `gpui::FollowMode::Normal`; resumed is `FollowMode::Tail`,
which is the mode conversation_view gives every new list. A plain scroll
up is still the implicit pause upstream has — it stops following until
the bottom is reached again — and is untouched. Every other caller that
scrolls to the end checks `is_following_tail()` first, so a paused view
is left alone; an explicit "Scroll to Bottom" still moves it without
resuming.

The state is the entry count at the pause, kept on the ThreadView, so it
is per thread and does not survive closing the thread.

Test: conversation_view tests,
`zeo_paused_auto_scroll_does_not_follow_and_counts_new_entries`. Verified 2026-11-09 in the prepared d2a4fb6 tree: cargo check --tests, cargo clippy --tests and cargo fmt --check clean, cargo test passing, on acp_thread, agent_servers, agent_ui and sidebar; the control's look is
for an Xvfb capture.
---

diff --git a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view.rs b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view.rs
index 3ff859b..54bc75b 100644
--- a/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view.rs
+++ b/crates/agent_ui/src/conversation_view.rs
@@ -11964,6 +11964,58 @@ pub(crate) mod tests {
         });
     }
 
+    // Zeo next proposal §5.8 (ask 28): a paused view never follows the tail, even at the
+    // bottom, counts what arrived while paused, and resuming follows again.
+    #[gpui::test]
+    async fn zeo_paused_auto_scroll_does_not_follow_and_counts_new_entries(
+        cx: &mut TestAppContext,
+    ) {
+        init_test(cx);
+        let (conversation_view, cx) =
+            setup_conversation_view(StubAgentServer::default_response(), cx).await;
+        let thread_view = active_thread(&conversation_view, cx);
+        let list_state = thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, _| view.list_state.clone());
+
+        thread_view.update(cx, |view, cx| view.toggle_auto_scroll_pause(cx));
+        assert!(!list_state.is_following_tail(), "paused: not following");
+        assert_eq!(
+            thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, cx| view.thread.read(cx).entries().len()),
+            thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, _| view
+                .auto_scroll_paused_at
+                .unwrap_or(usize::MAX)),
+            "the pause remembers where the thread was"
+        );
+
+        let thread = thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, _| view.thread.clone());
+        thread
+            .update(cx, |thread, cx| {
+                thread.handle_session_update(
+                    acp_v1::SessionUpdate::AgentMessageChunk(acp_v1::ContentChunk::new(
+                        "arrived while paused".into(),
+                    )),
+                    cx,
+                )
+            })
+            .expect("the update applies");
+        cx.run_until_parked();
+        assert!(
+            !list_state.is_following_tail(),
+            "new entries do not re-engage a paused view"
+        );
+        let new_entries = thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, cx| {
+            let at = view.auto_scroll_paused_at.expect("still paused");
+            view.thread.read(cx).entries().len() - at
+        });
+        assert_eq!(
+            new_entries, 1,
+            "the marker counts what arrived while paused"
+        );
+
+        thread_view.update(cx, |view, cx| view.toggle_auto_scroll_pause(cx));
+        assert!(list_state.is_following_tail(), "resumed: following again");
+        assert!(thread_view.read_with(cx, |view, _| view.auto_scroll_paused_at.is_none()));
+    }
+
     #[gpui::test]
     async fn test_restore_scroll_position_survives_deferred_markdown_parsing(
